{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-5-1","title":"Psalms 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David prays, and professes his study in prayer. 4 God favours not the wicked. 7 David, professing his faith, prays to God to guide him; 10 to destroy his enemies; 11 and to preserve the godly.</p>\n<p>Give. 17:1; 54:2; 55:1,2; 64:1; 80:1; 86:1; 1Pe 3:12; 1Jo 5:14,15 consider my. 19:14; 1Sa 1:13,16; *marg: Ro 8:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-2","title":"Psalms 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>unto the. 3:4 my King. 10:16; 24:7,8; 44:4; 47:6,7; 74:12; 99:1-4; 145:1; Isa 33:22 unto thee. 65:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-3","title":"Psalms 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>22:2; 55:17; 69:16; 88:13; 119:147; 130:6; Isa 26:9; Mr 1:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-4","title":"Psalms 5:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>God. 50:21; 1Ch 29:17; Hab 1:13; Mal 2:17 evil. 94:20; 101:7; 140:13; Joh 14:23; Heb 12:14; 2Pe 3:13; Re 21:23,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-5","title":"Psalms 5:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>The. 14:1; 92:6; 94:8; Pr 1:7,22; 8:5; Ec 5:4; Hab 1:13 stand. 1:5; 130:3 in thy sight. Heb. before thine eyes. thou. 10:3; Le 20:23; Pr 6:16-19; Ho 9:15; Zec 11:8; Mt 7:23; 25:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-6","title":"Psalms 5:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>destroy. 4:2; Re 21:8; 22:15 the bloody, etc. Heb. man of bloods and deceit. 26:8-10; 43:1; 55:23; Ge 34:14,25,26; 2Sa 16:8; 20:1; Isa 26:21 Ro 1:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-7","title":"Psalms 5:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>But. 55:16; Jos 24:15; Lu 6:11,12 in the. 51:1; 52:8; 69:13,16; Isa 55:7; Ro 5:20,21 in thy. 130:4; Ho 3:5; Ac 9:31; Heb 12:28,29; 1Pe 1:17-19 I worship. 28:2; 132:7; 138:2; 1Ki 8:29,30,35,38; Da 6:10; Heb 4:16 thy holy temple. Heb. the temple of thy holiness. Isa 64:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-8","title":"Psalms 5:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Lead. 25:4,5; 86:11; 119:10,64; 143:8-10; Pr 3:5,6 mine. Heb. those which observe me. 27:11; 54:5; 59:10; *marg: 2Sa 12:14 make. 25:4; 27:11; Pr 4:25; Mt 3:3; Heb 12:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-9","title":"Psalms 5:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>For. 36:1-4; 52:2; 58:3; 62:4,9; 111:1-3; Jer 9:3-6; Mic 6:12; Ro 1:29-31 Ro 3:13 faithfulness. or, stedfastness. their mouth. Heb. hismouth, that is, the mouth of any of them. inward. 51:6; 58:2; 62:4; *marg: 64:6; Jer 4:14; 17:9; Mr 7:21,22; Lu 11:39 very wickedness. Heb. wickednesses. throat. Lu 11:44; Ro 3:13 they. 12:2,3; Job 32:21,22; Pr 29:5; 1Th 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-10","title":"Psalms 5:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Destroy. or, Make them guilty. Ro 3:19,20 let. 7:9-15; 9:15,16; 10:15; 17:13; 21:8-10; 28:3,4; 31:18; 35:1-8,26 55:15; 59:12,13; 64:6-8; 66:7; 68:1,2; 69:22-25; 71:13; 79:12 83:9-18; 109:6-20; 137:7-9; 140:9,10; 144:6,7; De 2:30 1Sa 25:29,39; 2Sa 15:31; 17:14,23; 2Ch 25:16; Es 7:10; Job 5:12-14 1Co 3:19 by. or, from. the. La 1:5; Ho 9:7 they. Isa 1:2,20; 63:10; Da 9:5,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-11","title":"Psalms 5:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>But. 35:27; 40:16; 58:10; 68:3; 70:1-4; Jud 5:31; Isa 65:13-16; Re 18:20 Re 19:1-7 shout. 47:1-5; 65:13; Job 38:7; Zec 9:9 defendest. Heb. coverest over, or, protectest. love. 69:36; Ro 8:28; 1Co 2:9; Jas 1:12; 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-5-12","title":"Psalms 5:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>bless. 1:1-3; 3:8; 29:11; 112:1; 115:13 wilt. 32:10 compass. Heb. crown. shield. 3:3; 84:11</p>"}]}